"**🔴 Critical · bug** — \`cart.getTotal()\` now returns a Promise and isn't awaited

\`getTotal\` became async in this PR, so \`total\` is a Promise here. \`total <= 0\` is always false, which means an empty cart can check out.

**Suggested fix:**
\`\`\`ts
const total = await cart.getTotal();
\`\`\`

